  "slag.ponder.casting.header": "Casting Molten Fluids",
  "slag.ponder.casting.text_1": "Drains take fluid from the container they are attached to, such as a Crucible, and pour it downwards",
  "slag.ponder.casting.text_2": "A Casting Table catches the fluid, but needs a mold to shape it",
  "slag.ponder.casting.text_3": "Right-click the Drain to start pouring. It stops once the container below is full",
  "slag.ponder.casting.text_4": "Once it has cooled, Right-click with an empty hand to take out the result",
  "slag.ponder.casting.text_5": "Casting Basins work the same way, but cast whole blocks without a mold",
  "slag.ponder.casting.text_6": "A powered Drain keeps pouring whenever there is room below",
  "slag.ponder.crucible.header": "Heating and Filling Crucibles",
  "slag.ponder.crucible.text_1": "Crucibles take their heat from the blocks directly below them",
  "slag.ponder.crucible.text_2": "Their temperature is the average of every block underneath, so cover the whole floor for the most heat",
  "slag.ponder.crucible.text_3": "Molten fluids can be poured in with Buckets, or fed in by Melters",
  "slag.ponder.crucible.text_4": "When the Crucible is hot enough, fluids that make an alloy will mix on their own",
  "slag.ponder.crucible.text_5": "Sneak and Right-click with an empty hand to toggle the windows",
  "slag.ponder.fluid_interface.header": "Choosing which Fluid to Pour",
  "slag.ponder.fluid_interface.text_1": "A Crucible can hold many fluids at once, stacked in layers",
  "slag.ponder.fluid_interface.text_2": "Right-click the Fluid Interface to see every fluid inside",
  "slag.ponder.fluid_interface.text_3": "Selecting a fluid moves it to the bottom of the Crucible",
  "slag.ponder.fluid_interface.text_4": "Drains always pour from the bottom layer first",
  "slag.ponder.melter.header": "Melting Items",
  "slag.ponder.melter.text_1": "Melters turn items into molten fluid",
  "slag.ponder.melter.text_2": "They need a heat source directly below them",
  "slag.ponder.melter.text_3": "Items can be thrown in, inserted with Hoppers, or placed through its menu",
  "slag.ponder.melter.text_4": "Molten fluid is poured into the tank directly behind it",
  "slag.ponder.melter.text_5": "Weaker heat sources, such as Magma Blocks, melt items more slowly",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.header": "Building a Smeltery",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.text_1": "Crucibles are heated by the blocks placed beneath them",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.text_2": "Crucibles placed next to or on top of each other connect into one big tank",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.text_3": "Sneak and Right-click with an empty hand to toggle the windows",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.text_4": "Melters turn items into molten fluid and pour it into the tank behind them",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.text_5": "The Fluid Interface shows every fluid inside the Crucible",
  "slag.ponder.smeltery.text_6": "Drains move fluid from the container behind them into any fluid container below",
